---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout_project.astro';
---

<Layout title="El Rectangle | CyberSG" description="El Rectangle offers a powerful concept and a high-quality gastronomic experience, yet it lacked a digital presence. Our research, including user interviews and mystery shopping, revealed a significant friction point: users had misaligned expectations regarding the seating (bar vs. table) and the specific culinary proposal. The challenge was to translate the restaurant's authentic physical soul into a digital environment that clarified doubts and built trust.">
    <section class="section section--hero">
        UX/UI • Web Design & Development
        <div class="projects">
            <h1 class="display-text">El Rectangle | Open Kitchen Bar</h1>
            <svg class="ani-icon" width="280" height="300" viewBox="0 0 480 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M471.99 334.43L336.06 256l135.93-78.43c7.66-4.42 10.28-14.2 5.86-21.86l-32.02-55.43c-4.42-7.65-14.21-10.28-21.87-5.86l-135.93 78.43V16c0-8.84-7.17-16-16.01-16h-64.04c-8.84 0-16.01 7.16-16.01 16v156.86L56.04 94.43c-7.66-4.42-17.45-1.79-21.87 5.86L2.15 155.71c-4.42 7.65-1.8 17.44 5.86 21.86L143.94 256L8.01 334.43c-7.66 4.42-10.28 14.21-5.86 21.86l32.02 55.43c4.42 7.65 14.21 10.27 21.87 5.86l135.93-78.43V496c0 8.84 7.17 16 16.01 16h64.04c8.84 0 16.01-7.16 16.01-16V339.14l135.93 78.43c7.66 4.42 17.45 1.8 21.87-5.86l32.02-55.43c4.42-7.65 1.8-17.43-5.86-21.85"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="content-description">
            <div class="clients-wrapper">
                <div class="clients">
                    <img src="../images/elisava_logo.png" alt="Logo de Elisava"></img>
                    Elisava, School of Design & Engineering
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="meta-row">
            <div class="meta-item">
                <div class="content-subtitle">
                    <span>Role</span>
                </div>
                <div>Product Designer</div>
            </div>

            <div class="meta-item">
                <div class="content-subtitle">
                    <span>Timeline</span>
                </div>
                <div>2025-2026</div>
            </div>

            <div class="meta-item">
                <div class="content-subtitle">
                    <span>Stack</span>
                </div>
                <div>Figma, Ilustrator, Photoshop, After Effects, Astro, Tailwind CSS, JavaScript, React</div>
            </div>

            <div class="meta-item">
                <div class="content-subtitle">
                    <span>PROTOTYPE [//] LINK</span>
                </div>
                <a href="https://www.figma.com/proto/UqXSwNvkcV00xWpwK2TuhF/El-Rectangle?page-id=1381%3A1713&node-id=1381-2986&p=f&viewport=-745%2C703%2C0.07&t=3bGPmAHgVLaP5fze-1&scaling=min-zoom&content-scaling=fixed&starting-point-node-id=1381%3A2986" target="_blank">Figma Prototype</a>

                <div class="content-subtitle">
                    <span>PRODUCT [//] LINK</span>
                </div>
                <a href="https://rectangle-xi.vercel.app" target="_blank">https://rectangle-xi.vercel.app</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <video loop preload="none" autoplay muted class="image-large" src="../videos/rectangle/rectangle_1.webm"></video>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="content-split">
            <div class="copy-block">
                <div class="content-subtitle accent">01 [//] The Problem</div>
                <div class="copy">
                    <h2>Bridging the Physical-Digital Gap</h2>
                    <p>El Rectangle offers <strong><i>a powerful concept and a high-quality gastronomic experience</i></strong>, yet it lacked a digital presence. Our research, including user interviews and mystery shopping, revealed a significant friction point: <strong><i>users had misaligned expectations</i></strong> regarding the seating <strong><i>(bar vs. table)</i></strong> and the specific culinary proposal. The challenge was to translate the restaurant's authentic physical soul into a digital environment that clarified doubts and built trust.
                    <br><br>
                    <i>*Project assets and interface screens are presented in Spanish as per the initial requirements.</i>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--alt">
        <div class="content-split">
            <div class="copy-block">
                <div class="copy">
                    <div class="content-subtitle accent">02 [//] Goal</div>
                    <h2>Designing for Authenticity</h2>
                    <p>Based on our primary User Persona—international food enthusiasts seeking authentic local tapas—we focused on a service design strategy aimed at: <br><br>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Expectation Management</strong>: Clearly communicating the venue's layout and atmosphere to avoid confusion.</li>
                            <li><strong>Digital Personality</strong>: Mirroring the restaurant's values of closeness and personalization through a cohesive digital identity.</li>
                             <li><strong>Value-Added Experience</strong>: Moving beyond a simple "online menu" to create a guided digital journey.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="image-column">
                <img class="image" src="/images/rectangle/user_principal.avif" alt="Image of User Persona n°1">
                <img class="image" src="/images/rectangle/user_secundario.avif" alt="Image of User Persona n°2">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="content-split">
            <div class="copy-block">
                <div class="copy">
                    <div class="content-subtitle accent">03 [//] onboarding</div>
                    <h2>A Guided Culinary Journey</h2>
                    <p>We designed the website as a prelude to the physical visit. To enhance the <strong><i>"closeness"</i></strong> before the user even steps into the restaurant, we implemented:<br><br>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>The Recommender</strong>: An interactive tool that guides users through the menu based on their preferences, acting as a digital host.</li>
                            <li><strong>Gamified Loyalty</strong>: Introduced the "Magic Dice" concept at the payment stage to add a layer of gamification and post-visit engagement, strengthening the bond with the customer.</li>
                        </ul>             
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="image-column">
                <img class="image" src="/images/rectangle/collage.avif" alt="Image of a collage that shows part of the process">
                <img class="image" src="/images/rectangle/collage_2.avif" alt="Image of a collage that shows part of the process">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>


    <section class="section section--alt">
        <div class="content-split">
            <div class="copy-block">
                <div class="copy">
                    <div class="content-subtitle accent">04 [//] EXECUTION</div>
                    <h2>Testing & Refinement</h2>
                    <p>The execution was rooted in rigorous validation. After the initial design phase, we conducted user testing to iterate on the flow.<br><br>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Information Architecture</strong>: Simplified the booking and menu exploration process to ensure a frictionless experience.</li>
                            <li><strong>Visual Storytelling</strong>: Used high-quality imagery and a warm, authentic interface to reflect the tactile experience of a traditional yet modern tapas bar in Barcelona.</li>
                        </ul>          
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="image-column">
                <img class="image" src="/images/rectangle/arquitecturaInformation.avif" alt="Image of Information Architecture">
                <img class="image" src="/images/rectangle/flujoReserva.avif" alt="Image of the Booking userflow">
                <img class="image" src="/images/rectangle/flujoRecomendador.avif" alt="Image of the Recommender userflow">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <img class="image" src="/images/rectangle/moodboard.avif" alt="Image of the Rectangle's Moodboard">
        <img class="image" src="/images/rectangle/materialization.avif" alt="Image of the Rectangle's style sheet and branding">
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="content-split">
            <div class="copy-block">
                <div class="copy">
                    <div class="content-subtitle accent">05 [//] OVERVIEW</div>
                    <h2>Seamless Service Design</h2>
                    <p>This Elisava Master's project resulted in a holistic digital solution that aligns El Rectangle's online image with its physical excellence.<br><br>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Outcome</strong>: A website that functions as a strategic touchpoint, reducing user uncertainty and increasing engagement through personalization.</li>
                            <li><strong>Collaborative Success</strong>: Developed in a multidisciplinary team, proving that deep research and user testing are the foundations of a successful digital service.</li>
                        </ul>             
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="image-column">
                <img class="image" src="/images/rectangle/mockup_2.avif" alt="Image of the web design implementation">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>


    <section class="section">
        <img class="image" src="/images/rectangle/mockup_1.avif" alt="Image of the web design implementation">
        <img class="image" src="/images/rectangle/mockup_3.avif" alt="Image of the web design implementation">
        <video loop preload="none" autoplay muted class="image-large" src="../videos/rectangle/rectangle_2.webm"></video>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container center">
            <div class="block">
                <span class="content-subtitle accent center">[//] Next Project [//]</span>
                <a class="next-project" href="../work/e-Qapla">e-Qapla
                    <svg 
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M3 12h17.5"/><path d="M21 12l-7 7M21 12l-7 -7"/></g></svg>
                </a>
            </div>
            <a class="button small fit" href="../work">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" d="m4 10l-.354.354L3.293 10l.353-.354zm16.5 8a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0zM8.646 15.354l-5-5l.708-.708l5 5zm-5-5.708l5-5l.708.708l-5 5zM4 9.5h10v1H4zM20.5 16v2h-1v-2zM14 9.5a6.5 6.5 0 0 1 6.5 6.5h-1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-5.5-5.5z"/></svg>     
                Back to All Work
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>